\[
S_{\max}= \frac{(1+4049)^2}{4\cdot1\cdot4049}
        =\frac{4050^{2}}{4\cdot4049}
        =\frac{4100625}{4049}.
\]

The fraction is already reduced because \(\gcd(4100625,4049)=1\).

