                caps = [i for i in range(1, n)] + [n-1]  # length n
                # Ensure caps list length n
                # We'll try to reduce degrees to make graphic while maximizing sum
                # We'll use a simple greedy: while not graphic, reduce the largest degree that can be reduced (i.e., >0) by 1.
